png","Simplified World Generation","It's the old v. 1.0.4 generation. Similar to default, but it's more light on performance. The difference here are: 1 big central desert region, 2 mixed savanna/jungle bands. The world is miniaturized in this example to fit in the map","2025-05-10T01:11:42.711221Z",{"url":307,"raw_url":308,"featured":13,"title":309,"description":310,"created":311,"ordering":312},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QZt2fevq/images/5d0fa5597e8f9722116e56723bf3118abd9313fe_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QZt2fevq/images/5d0fa5597e8f9722116e56723bf3118abd9313fe.png","Linear World Generation","Like the simplified, but only Cold biomes in the north, hot in the south. THIS MODE CAN'T LOOP. The world is miniaturized in this example to fit in the map","2025-07-07T20:34:32.959810Z",3,{"url":314,"raw_url":315,"featured":13,"title":316,"description":317,"created":318,"ordering":319},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QZt2fevq/images/99587ed4e496d00228a6239e2f982527006b8a27_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QZt2fevq/images/99587ed4e496d00228a6239e2f982527006b8a27.png","Custom Circular World Generation","A special type of generaion. R = equatorial_distance. Default settings: 1) Temperate zone 2) Random zone + transition 3) Warm zone + transition. Outiside of the radius it's frozen. This mode is customizable in the config file with \"temperature_zone_x\"","2025-12-08T17:10:02.741392Z",4,{"url":321,"raw_url":322,"featured":13,"title":323,"description":324,"created":325,"ordering":326},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QZt2fevq/images/ad578e924e0b36f6a30b6f420e25c3dbf70f8d23_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QZt2fevq/images/ad578e924e0b36f6a30b6f420e25c3dbf70f8d23.png","Circular World Generation","It's like the simplified wg but in a circular shape, it uses the same divisions in 4 zones and R like the custom circular mode","2026-01-04T09:20:40.020425Z",5,{"url":328,"raw_url":329,"featured":13,"title":330,"description":331,"created":332,"ordering":333},"h